    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">One-Quarter Tank Fuel Regulation:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">To avoid spills or leakage during transportation, it is essential to fill the fuel tank to just one-quarter capacity. This prevents fuel spills and ensures a safe journey for both the vehicle and the environment.</p>
